      "widgets_values": [
        "Minimalist bold vector game icon. A very short wide light-grey bean creature with two tiny pointed ears on top and a little curved tail, and two tiny round feet. The entire character is a single horizontal oval, twice as wide as it is tall. Two small round black dots and a tiny horizontal black dash form the entire face. There are three short charcoal stripes on its forehead and two stripes on the tail. Uniform extra thick black outline around every shape. Flat light-grey fill. Flat charcoal markings. Pure white background. Very simple iconic silhouette, clean crisp graphic shapes, no shading, no highlights, no texture, no other facial details. The character resembles a tiny minimalist cat from a casual mobile action game."
